      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2100332461657866432",
        "text": "Who the heck designed that?\n\nSame asset, two different interfaces with different decimals and a conversion schema in between.\n\n🤡 Absolutely bonkers. Insane.\n\nIf you are starting something new ... make things simpler god darn it 🤦 https://t.co/JSvlyGDKvd",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "LefterisJP",
          "name": "Lefteris Karapetsas"
        }
      }
